@startuml system-context
title Smart Drainage System - System Context Diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
left to right direction

actor "Operator\n(drainage maintenance staff)" as Operator
actor "Administrator" as Admin

rectangle "Water level sensor\n(ultrasonic) + ESP32\n(or Python simulator)" as Device
rectangle "Smart Drainage System\n(API server, PostgreSQL,\nweb dashboard)" as System #LightBlue
cloud "Wi-Fi network" as WiFi
rectangle "Pump\n(optional / simulated)" as Pump #LightGray

Device --> WiFi : water level measurements\n(HTTP REST, JSON)
WiFi --> System : POST /api/v1/measurements
System --> Operator : current level, status,\nhistory, warnings
Operator --> System : view data
Admin --> System : configure thresholds
System ..> Pump : pump command\n(optional, with safety checks)
@enduml
